  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Social tags and public instance tags would be a nice addition to VRChat seeing how you would be able to find open instances using tags, these instances are more likely to have people with similar interests, instead of loading into a random instance not knowing who you will find making you more anxious to speak with someone. \n\nSocial tags would play the same role here where you could search people with matching interests or social groups / guilds\n\nGuilds would be a nice addition \nRight now I have a ridiculous amount of friends I don’t remember at all, it would be nice to be part of a social group(s) with customizable nameplate colors and icons for VRC+ members that appears above the name similar to the yellow friend icon, None vrc+ would see a default guild icon\n\nExamples\nSo I like to use VRC for language learning, specifically Korean.  It would be a nice touch if I could join a Korean learning group where I can see active instances which I can go join on fellow members then pinpoint who is a member via color nameplate and icon like a circular Korean flag",
